# Git attribution

Never add Cursor attribution to git history or pull requests.

- Do not add `Co-authored-by: Cursor`, `Made-with: Cursor`, or any `cursoragent@cursor.com` trailer.
- Do not pass `--trailer` flags to `git commit` for Cursor attribution.
- Do not add attribution footers to `gh pr create`.
- Commits in this repository must attribute only the human maintainer.

If a commit message already contains Cursor attribution, remove it before committing.
